--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0ca23d3e41cd5424c9ec72c610ef25a4, type: 3}
  m_Name: ep5Intro
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  autoFocusSpeaker: 1
  screens:
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685876
    - rid: 4351268418678685877
    - rid: 4351268418678685878
    - rid: 4351268418678685879
    - rid: 4351268418678685880
    - rid: 4351268418678685881
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: Uuugh...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685882
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: It's morning already?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I guess it's a good thing we didn't get attacked in the middle of the
      night.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Is Monika still asleep?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I look directly to my right, finding Monika still asleep next to me.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268418678685883
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Looks like I get to lay around some more.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 'Such a wonderful opportunity to treat others the way I want to be treated:
      not getting woken up.'
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: I have to pee.
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Trying not to wake Monika up, I slowly slither out of my bedroll...
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Huh, wha-?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521654
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: Dang it!
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Oh, good morning, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521655
    - rid: 4351268438874521656
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Did you know that you move around in your sleep?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521658
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: What?
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Yeah, your right leg was sort of jiggling through the whole night-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Which I suppose was better than having to sleep in <i>this</i> cold without
      extra body heat-
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521659
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: But still, it's something you should be aware of.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521660
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I'm sorry...?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521661
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Like I said, I'd take it over the cold any day of the week, so don't
      beat yourself up about it.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521662
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: So, what're we doing with this Elder Scroll again?
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521663
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: We're going to be heading back to High Hrothgar, but first-
    ScreenActions: []
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 905407d7a8ed6004ebfd47e9529ecf8c, type: 2}
    dialog: I've got some <i>business</i> to take care of, so let me do that first.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521664
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: Alright, {mc}.
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521665
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: ...
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521673
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (And a good morning to <b>you</b>, too.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521666
    - rid: 4351268438874521672
  - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: bcc4aa0537be91d488c1075e0cd8d29a, type: 2}
    dialog: (I'm guessing we've got a big day ahead of us.)
    ScreenActions:
    - rid: 4351268438874521667
  - speaker: {fileID: 0}
    dialog: 
    ScreenActions: []
